			<item>
				<title>我的第一篇博客</title>
				<link>https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/my-first-post/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/my-first-post/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;这是我建立博客以来的第一篇文章，感觉非常神奇！&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;这是一级标题前面加两个井号和一个空格&#34;&gt;这是一级标题（前面加两个井号和一个空格）&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;这是二级标题前面加三个井号&#34;&gt;这是二级标题（前面加三个井号）&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;这是一段普通的正文。如果你想让文字加粗，可以使用 &lt;strong&gt;加粗文字&lt;/strong&gt;（两边各加两个星号）。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;下面是一个简单的列表：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;第一件事：建好了博客框架&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;第二件事：修改了好看的主题和名字&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;第三件事：成功发布了第一篇文章！&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;做一个修改&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>About</title>
				<link>https://demo.stack.cai.im/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://demo.stack.cai.im/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;who-is-this-for&#34;&gt;Who is this for?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is a sample &lt;strong&gt;About&lt;/strong&gt; page. You can use it to introduce yourself, your blog, or your project.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;about-the-author&#34;&gt;About the Author&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hello! I&amp;rsquo;m a passionate blogger and open-source enthusiast. I love exploring new technologies and sharing my experiences with the community.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;my-journey&#34;&gt;My Journey&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I started my journey in web development over 10 years ago. Since then, I&amp;rsquo;ve worked on numerous projects ranging from small personal blogs to large-scale enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Image Gallery</title>
				<link>https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Stack theme has a built-in support for image galleries. It allows you to create a beautiful gallery by simply placing multiple images side-by-side.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;sample-gallery&#34;&gt;Sample Gallery&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/florian-klauer-nptLmg6jqDo-unsplash.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo by Florian Klauer on Unsplash&#34;&gt;  &lt;img src=&#34;https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/luca-bravo-alS7ewQ41M8-unsplash.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo by Luca Bravo on Unsplash&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/helena-hertz-wWZzXlDpMog-unsplash.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo by Helena Hertz on Unsplash&#34;&gt;  &lt;img src=&#34;https://demo.stack.cai.im/p/image-gallery/hudai-gayiran-3Od_VKcDEAA-unsplash.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Photo by Hudai Gayiran on Unsplash&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-it-works&#34;&gt;How it works&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The gallery is powered by &lt;strong&gt;Photoswipe&lt;/strong&gt; and a custom internal script. It automatically calculates the best layout for your images based on their aspect ratios.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
